{
  "declaredLength": 2572,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "我們為什麼會在這種地方？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211501170BA4EC09EBC6703572890197A2E573065B9FF1F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這裡就是那個叫\n異次元密阿雷的地方吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901988E15C31662F90A3500B53EB000A75706B2151435BC6963F96F77684573065B95427300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這麼說起來，我也是某個人的\n潛意識創造出來的存在。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90199EBC8AAA8D774F86FF0C62114E5F662F67D0500B4EBA7684000A6F5B610F8B585275902051FA4F8676845B585728300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "新閃焰隊的兩位，\n我有事想問你們。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以請和我們對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65B095837130968A768451694F4DFF0C000A621167094E8B60F3554F4F605011300200100001BE00000A62404EE58ACB548C621150115C0D62305427FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳會幫忙的吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B367035E6B5FD976845427FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "757671360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原來如此。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是打算先徹底掌握現在的狀況對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F4F8659826B643002000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F62537B9751485FB95E95638C63E173FE5728768472C06CC15C0D5427300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000><U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一起迎戰，\n就一定能贏的～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981548C001000020100000000100003110000FF01014F6059B34E008D778FCE6230FF0C000A5C314E005B9A80FD8D0F7684FF5EFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒被基格爾德選上的悔恨，\n一直在我的心中冒著煙……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n為了消除這份悔恨，我也希望一戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9288AB57FA683C723E5FB790784E0A768460946068FF0C000A4E0076F45728621176845FC34E2D5192845771592026202600100001BE00000A70BA4E866D88966490194EFD60946068FF0C62114E5F5E0C671B4E006230300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰是行，\n但<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳輸了就來打工吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D6230662F884CFF0C000A4F4600100003110000FF01014F6059B38F384E865C314F8662535DE55427300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會贏的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167038D0F76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不打算這麼做",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D62537B9790199EBC505A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不能只是冒著煙，\n得熊熊燃燒才行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D80FD53EA662F519284577159FF0C000A5F97718A718A71C371D2624D884CFF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噴火龍啊，吐出黑暗的火焰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5674706B9F8D554AFF0C541051FA9ED166977684706B71305427FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳到底想做什麼……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B352305E9560F3505A4EC09EBC2026202600100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要燒掉<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的一切！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898171D2638900100003110000FF01014F6059B376844E005207FF0100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想知道更多大叔的事，\n像是閃焰隊到底做了什麼事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F377E5905366F4591A592753D476844E8BFF0C000A50CF662F95837130968A52305E95505A4E864EC09EBC4E8B300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了燦爛地燃燒到最後一刻，\n用超級進化猛烈燃燒吧，噴火龍！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E8671E6721B573071C371D2523067005F8C4E00523BFF0C000A75288D857D1A90325316731B70C871C371D25427FF0C5674706B9F8DFF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了作為新咖啡的一員重獲新生，\n我要讓你們看看燃燒生命的超級進化！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E864F5C70BA65B05496556176844E0054E191CD737265B0751FFF0C000A621189818B934F605011770B770B71C371D2751F547D76848D857D1A90325316FF0100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓你們見識一下，不只是我們……\n還有和大叔他們的牽絆！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B934F605011898B8B584E004E0BFF0C4E0D53EA662F6211501120262026000A90846709548C592753D44ED650117684727D7D46FF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你們還記得對戰前的約定嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60501190848A185F975C0D6230524D76847D045B9A55CEFF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "757671364E86300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大叔他……庫瑟洛斯奇\n為什麼會在閃焰隊活動呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592753D44ED6202620265EAB745F6D1B65AF5947000A70BA4EC09EBC6703572895837130968A6D3B52D55462FF1F00100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就像寶可夢透過超級進化來強化一樣，\n當時他在研究是否能強化人類。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n研究結果正是擴充強化服。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3150CF5BF653EF5922900F904E8D857D1A903253164F865F3753164E006A23FF0C000A757666424ED6572878147A76662F542680FD5F3753164EBA985E300200100001BE01000A78147A767D50679C6B63662F64F451455F375316670D300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原本應該是由我們來測試，\n不知為何受試者變成了妳。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F672C61C98A72662F7531621150114F866E2C8A66FF0C000A4E0D77E570BA4F5553D78A6680058B8A62104E8659B3300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們知道的就是這些了。\n我們和庫瑟洛斯奇沒什麼往來。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211501177E5905376845C31662F90194E9B4E863002000A62115011548C5EAB745F6D1B65AF59476C924EC09EBC5F804F86300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大叔很溫柔喔。\n所以我想知道他是個什麼樣的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592753D45F886EAB67D455943002000A62404EE5621160F377E590534ED6662F500B4EC09EBC6A2376844EBA300200100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他應該是個把研究擺第一的人吧。\n但也擁有對妳的溫柔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED661C98A72662F500B628A78147A7664FA7B2C4E0076844EBA54273002000A4F464E5F64C167095C0D59B376846EAB67D4300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "人是種矛盾的生物。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也這麼想吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EBA662F7A2E77DB76FE7684751F72693002000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F90199EBC60F35427FF1F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回憶是不會變的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE61B6662F4E0D67038B8A76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那份溫柔是真實的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34EFD6EAB67D4662F771F5BE676840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1DFF0100100002011400080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是謝禮。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n因為我好像知道自己沒有\n被基格爾德選上的理由了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F8B1D79AE300200100001BE01000A56E070BA6211597D50CF77E5905381EA5DF16C926709000A88AB57FA683C723E5FB790784E0A7684740675314E86300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>獲得了\n古歷裝扮廚師裝組合！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000073725F974E86000A53E46B7788DD626E5EDA5E2B88DD7D445408FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳要是想在新咖啡打工了，\n就穿上它吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B38981662F60F3572865B05496556162535DE54E86FF0C000A5C317A7F4E0A5B835427300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那可不行。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>是能為了城市裡\n所有的寶可夢和人們行動的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A353EF4E0D884C300200100001BE01000A0010000201000000662F80FD70BA4E8657CE5E0288E1000A6240670976845BF653EF5922548C4EBA5011884C52D576844EBA300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可不能讓打工妨礙<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n當然如果咖啡店有什麼事的話，\n我會找<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳商量的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4E0D80FD8B9362535DE559A8791900100003110000FF01014F6059B3300200100001BE01000A757671365982679C549655615E9767094EC09EBC4E8B76848A71FF0C000A62116703627E00100003110000FF01014F6059B3554691CF7684300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "各式各樣的寶可夢和\n人們生存的態度，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n都滲透在密阿雷市的每個角落。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54045F0F54046A2376845BF653EF5922548C000A4EBA5011751F5B587684614B5EA6FF0C00100001BE00000A90FD6EF2900F57285BC6963F96F75E0276846BCF500B89D2843D300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這還真是個煞風景的異次元密阿雷呢。\n到底是誰的願望啊……？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
